reviews.text:
The Lucky Pork Chops are crispy on the body, but the onions underneath are undercooked and still raw;
There are whole uncut onion hearts inside, and the shredded carrots of the side dishes are not cut off;
The sauce for shredded cabbage is very unpleasant.
There was strange floating matter in the drinks from the soda machine.

2024.07.18
♡Kaiyun Pork Chops Set Meal ($210)｜The pork chops are delicious even though they are not wood-fired! If you like the sweet sauce, the waiting time is about 8 minutes. Personally, I don’t think the wait will be long as the rice is a bit soft.
〔Remark〕
